  "source_revision_id": "xhs-note:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104",
  "source_manifest_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:sequence-v1",
  "source_manifest_sha256": "2c4eddf553becedb97c2ea2eec8d72b17a0edf3330e40e07380ef5baae4a5e0f",
  "questions": [
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u1:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u1",
      "unit_position": 1,
      "raw_text": "1.自我介绍",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u2:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u2",
      "unit_position": 2,
      "raw_text": "2.你觉得就是从技术角度以及你个人的角度，你跟这个岗位的匹配性是怎样的 实习过程最大的收获是什么呢？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u3:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u3",
      "unit_position": 3,
      "raw_text": "3.像这种互联网的大厂，可能你的工作内容只聚焦在那一个很小的领域，那你觉得就是从长远自身的发展或者是技术能力的提升上来讲，这样的话会不会给你带来一些不好的影响？或者是你未来的话会怎么提升自己的技术能力？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u4:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u4",
      "unit_position": 4,
      "raw_text": "4.你未来的话就是比如说工作地点这边你是怎么考虑的呀？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u5:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u5",
      "unit_position": 5,
      "raw_text": "5.就是长期来看的话 对小米的认识多吗？或者是你有没有经常用一些小米的产品，或者是关注一些小米的一些发布会等等嗯",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u6:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u6",
      "unit_position": 6,
      "raw_text": "6.你觉得就是作为一个后端的工程师来讲，你觉得最重要的一些基本素质是什么？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u7:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u7",
      "unit_position": 7,
      "raw_text": "7.作为研发来讲，其实日常对接最多一个就是业务嗯，就是你在你过往的实际经历当中，就是你跟产品和业务的沟通当中有没有遇到什么困难？然后是怎么解决的？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u8:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u8",
      "unit_position": 8,
      "raw_text": "8.你在实习当中有没有遇到就是项目资源很紧张，就是排期时间也很紧张的这种情况？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u9:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u9",
      "unit_position": 9,
      "raw_text": "9.你大三的时候就确定了就是毕业之后就工作嘛，那你当时是怎么考虑的？因为现在很多人其实都是考研的概率比较大你当时是怎么考虑的？ 10.其实作为一个工程师来讲，它的未来的职业发展基本上就两条道路，一个就是走管理方向，一个就是走专家方向。那你觉得你自己比较适合哪个方向",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u10:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u10",
      "unit_position": 10,
      "raw_text": "11.说出你的三个优点与缺点",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
    {
      "source_question_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u11:sq1",
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u11",
      "unit_position": 11,
      "raw_text": "12.反问环节",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    }
  ],
